WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:42.099 --> 00:00:45.280
My brother told me that there's a shortcut
through the woods.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.049
I don't know.

00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:48.109
C'mon, don't be scared.

00:00:48.109 --> 00:00:48.750
I'm not scared!

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.250
Then let's go!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:54.150
It could be dangerous over there. There could be coyotes.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.789
If my brother's done it, it must be safe.

00:00:57.789 --> 00:00:59.700
Well... I guess you're right.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.770
I say we try it.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.670
Have you been in there before?

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:05.330
I haven't but my brother has.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.010
What if we get lost?

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:10.080
I can ask my brother the way through and we can go next week.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.210
Deal.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.500
Shake on it?

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.200
What's wrong?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.040
These kids...

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.500
Let's go!

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.019
Think this forest is safe?

00:01:44.019 --> 00:01:48.200
It... it will be... fine. Let's just hurry.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.000
Crap, how are we supposed to get across?

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.300
I think I see a way across.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.000
You lead the way.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.000
Both: Whoa!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.719
Are you thinking what I'm thinking?

00:03:19.719 --> 00:03:22.600
New hangout spot?

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.220
This is going to be awesome.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.320
Which way do you think our neighborhood is?

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:29.520
Hmm... let's see.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.130
Spare coins?

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.530
Yeah, I think I have some left over from lunch.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.000
Thank you very much. Have a great day.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.340
See? There's nothing scary in this forest.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.100
There you are. Did you bring the requested dosage?

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:23.890
Yeah, I got it.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.090
Wait, don't.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:25.990
What?

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.590
We aren't alone here.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:39.590
We need a rendezvous point. Somewhere we can safely make the exchange. Most of my usual spots have been compromised, like this one.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.190
Any ideas?

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.190
Let's see. Maybe the bridge?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.990
No. Exposed.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:48.990
Maybe the old factory?

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:49.839
We tried it, they've got a watch on that place.

00:07:49.839 --> 00:07:53.289
Can't we just do it at someone's house?

00:07:53.289 --> 00:07:54.949
Like your house?

00:07:54.949 --> 00:07:57.549
Well... usually my parents are home and--
exactly.

00:07:57.549 --> 00:07:59.849
Well, what about the forest?

00:07:59.849 --> 00:08:04.169
Oh yeah! We used to hang out there all the
time as kids! No one goes in there. It's perfect.

00:08:04.169 --> 00:08:06.659
I hadn't thought of a forest. Which one did
you have in mind?

00:08:06.659 --> 00:08:09.589
The one on the side of Puertia Lane. By the
curve, you know?

00:08:09.589 --> 00:08:13.709
Yeah, I'm familiar with the neighborhood.
Be there at 5pm tonight. Sharp.

00:08:13.709 --> 00:08:17.989
OK, but if you ever want to do business again,
leave my brother's shop alone. No more vandalism.

00:08:17.989 --> 00:08:19.719
Just stay away from there from now on.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:22.119
And you won't find this stuff anywhere else
in town.

00:08:23.019 --> 00:08:24.619
Just have it in full, and on time.

00:08:24.619 --> 00:08:27.769
Just follow the path until you get to the
meadow.

00:08:27.769 --> 00:08:32.369
I'll be waiting. Don't bring anyone.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.340
Haven't been here for a while.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:49.700
Yeah, can you remember we used to chill here
every day?

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.981
Those were the good days.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:02.000
Before I got tied up in all the drug dealing
shit behind my brother's shop. Man, I miss

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.631
being a kid.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:54.089
Looks like you two were on time. Do you have
the requested dosage?

00:09:54.089 --> 00:09:56.790
Yeah. Right here.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:10:03.790
Let's take a look.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.329
What is this?

00:10:05.329 --> 00:10:05.660
What?

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:08.410
I made it clear to how much I wanted, and
what the hell is this?

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.210
Whoa, whoa. Whoa. Whoa.

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.110
Where is the rest of it?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.810
Hey, we can get you some more.

00:10:16.919 --> 00:10:20.419
I need it now, don't you get it? You guys
are DEAD!

00:10:21.619 --> 00:10:23.019
After them!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.000
Hey!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.600
There he is!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.700
Ah! My eyes! Can't see!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:05.400
Gimme the gun.

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:06.000
Take it.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:08.000
I'm right here! Ahh.

00:12:39.329 --> 00:12:42.329
Let's get you out of here.

00:12:42.329 --> 00:12:46.200
I think there really was something scary in these woods Zeke.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:48.600
It was us.

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.200
C'mon stay with me.

